        "body": "<div>Hello Amin,</div><div> </div><div>My name is Jaymes and I'm a PhD student at Claremont Graduate University. I'm also the student of Dr. Saida Heshmati (whom you recently met in person). We might have met a long time ago (maybe a year or two?).</div><div> </div><div>I would like to schedule a brief online call to discuss Avicenna and some EMA features/suggestions for current and future projects that will be conducted under Saida's research program.</div><div> </div><div> I can try to accommodate your schedule (e.g., Calendly); perhaps a quick meeting sometime next week or after (Week of September 23<sup>rd</sup> or 30th).</div><div> </div><div>Cheers,</div><div> </div><div>\n<p><span style=\" color: rgb(102, 12, 4);\">--------</span> </p>\n<p><span style=\" color: rgb(102, 12, 4);\"><b>Jaymes Paolo Rombaoa, MA</b></span><span> <a href=\"https://www.name-coach.com/jaymespaolo-rombaoa-fff0485a-781d-4d40-8828-12b4538cb22e\" title=\"https://www.name-coach.com/jaymespaolo-rombaoa-fff0485a-781d-4d40-8828-12b4538cb22e\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img style=\"max-width:100%;width: 86px;max-height: 25px;max-width: initial;\" src=\"/api/v1/ticket_attachment/25076/76731/129877?view=inline\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\" color: rgb(102, 12, 4);\"><b>PhD Graduate Student, <i>Positive Developmental Psychology</i></b></span> </p>\n<p>Division of Behavioral &amp; Organizational Sciences</p>\n<p>Claremont Graduate University</p>\n<p>(714) 231-7461</p>\n<p><span style=\" color: rgb(0, 0, 106);\"><a href=\"mailto:jaymes.paolo-rombaoa@cgu.edu\">jaymes.paolo-rombaoa@cgu.edu</a></span> </p>\n<p><span><a href=\"https://pronouns.org/\" title=\"https://pronouns.org/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Pronouns</a>: he, him, his</span> </p>\n<p><span style=\" color: rgb(0, 0, 106);\"><a href=\"https://www.heshmatiwellbeinglab.com/\" title=\"https://www.heshmatiwellbeinglab.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" 