        "body": "Hi Jaymes,<div><br></div><div>It's nice to hear from you. Hope all is well.</div><div><br></div><div>I'd be more than happy to arrange a call. My calendar is shared <a href=\"https://calendar.app.google/k3qhxemdRRqxz5bT6\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://calendar.app.google/k3qhxemdRRqxz5bT6\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> and my schedule is flexible next week, feel free to choose a time that works best for you.</div><div><br></div><div>Looking forward to it.</div><div>Best,</div><div>Amin</div><div>\n<span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">--</span><div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"4\">Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div></div>\n<div>Email: sales@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<br><br>\n</div>\n<div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Thursday, September 19, 2024 at 10:33:53 AM, jaymes-paolo Rombaoa wrote:<br><br><div>Hello Amin,</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>My name is Jaymes and I'm a PhD student at Claremont Graduate University. I'm also the student of Dr. Saida Heshmati (whom you recently met in person). We might have met a long time ago (maybe a year or two?).</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>I would like to schedule a brief online call to discuss Avicenna and some EMA features/suggestions for current and future projects that will be conducted under Saida's research program.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> I can try to accommodate your schedule (e.g., Calendly); perhaps a quick meeting sometime next week or after (Week of September 23<sup>rd</sup> or 30th).</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Cheers,</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\" color: rgb(102, 12, 4);\">--------</span> </p>\n<p><span style=\" color: rgb(102, 12, 4);\"><b>Jaymes Paolo Rombaoa, MA</b></span><span> <a href